Z||000000||Dslice||12-22-2001||11:06 AM||||Last nite I noticed what at first was a neon(easy kill) coming up behind me, but when he pulled up next to me it was a brand new Z24 Caviler. I new He wanted to race so at the next stop light we went for it. He was faster than I, but not by much. He couldnt get quite get around me. Plus I didnt do a clutch drop cause I got a lot of miles on it. We also did the rolling start too, same result. I was happy I did as well as I did eventhough I counted as a loss for me. Besides I paid a lot less for my car and its damn sexy!<BR><P>------------------<BR>Rick<P>86GT<BR>84COUP<BR>http://home.mn.rr.com/gmfierogt||||reg||1
