Z||000003||BlackStang95||12-22-2001||12:03 PM||||A friend of mine at driving school had a modded (riced) z24.  I called it the Lexus Cavalier.  He had big chrome rims and real hid headlights put on, some kinda new exhaust, also a ground effects kit and he stripped every badge indicating the model off.  Lol, not enough to fool me.  Inside he had some stuff painted and I noticed it was an auto.  We went at it on a 2 lane semi-highway one night and I had little trouble.  I think a fiero gt in good shape should be able to take one, but I only raced the auto so who knows.||||reg||1
