Z||000007||Dslice||12-23-2001||01:19 AM||||I doubt it was a 3.1 you beat, it was probably the 2.4l twin cam(150hp) that you beat. This guy was no doubt faster than any stock Fiero, given not but a whole lot. The Z24 coup weighs in at about 2850 which is proably what my GT weighs with stereo system. Off the start he wasnt fast but but about 40mph or so you could tell the technology diff in our two engine. I wish I had twin cams.<P>------------------<BR>Rick<P>86GT<BR>84COUP<BR>http://home.mn.rr.com/gmfierogt||||reg||1
